msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Sawada went and got himself arrested. Police found him\r\n"
"in his office, all roughed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"He's returned most of our money, but now he wants to repay\r\n"
"the rest in tuna. How is that going to help? I can't pay\r\n"
"my bills with fish!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I guess we should be happy he's trying to pay us back at\r\n"
"all. And it's not every day we get to have an entire tuna\r\n"
"to ourselves..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Swindled Manager"
msgstr ""

